{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Read-only doc preflight. Do not edit anything. Do not delegate further.\n\nRead GitHub issue #17 (`gh issue view 12`), spec #4 (`gh issue view 4` and its comments), and the owner rulings already posted on #7, #9, #10, #11, #12, #13 (`gh issue view N --comments`). Assume #7–#13 land as ruled. Then read the code on origin/main that #17 touches (src/cli.rs, tests/cli_e2e.rs, and whatever the ticket names).\n\nList, max 250 words total, one line each:\n1. Contradictions between #17, #4, the rulings and the code.\n2. Defaults or formats #17 leaves unstated that the lane must pick.\n3. Failure cases with no stated behaviour.\n4. Acceptance criteria that fight the spec or the code.\nFor each give your recommended ruling in a few words, preferring the smallest change. End with a STATUS line.\n\nAlso read the #6 probe findings comment on #4 and the recorded fixtures under tests/fixtures/ (pi/, claude/, cursor/) on origin/main; flag where #17's parser must differ from what those fixtures show.\n\nEnd your final message with a single trailing line that is exactly one of: STATUS: DONE, STATUS: DONE_WITH_CONCERNS, STATUS: BLOCKED, STATUS: NEEDS_CONTEXT, or STATUS: ERROR. When you need an answer from the orchestrator before you can proceed, put your question in the message body and end with STATUS: NEEDS_CONTEXT."}]},"session_id":"42a2d878-df96-4e92-9fef-880dad80ff16"}
