Make precise file edits with exact text replacement, including multiple disjoint edits in one call\\n- write: Create or overwrite files\\n\\nIn addition to the tools above, you may have access to other custom tools depending on the project.\\n</tools>\",\"rules\":\"<rules>\\n- Use read to examine files instead of cat or sed.\\n- Use edit for precise changes (edits[].oldText must match exactly)\\n- When changing multiple separate locations in one file, use one edit call with multiple entries in edits[] instead of multiple edit calls\\n- Each edits[].oldText is matched against the original file, not after earlier edits are applied. Do not em [... omitted end of long line]","contentTruncated":false,"isContextLine":false}]},{"file":"./tests/fixtures/cursor/preflight-13.stdout","matches":[{"lineNumber":31,"content":"{\"type\":\"tool_call\",\"subtype\":\"completed\",\"call_id\":\"tool_fca866d8-f4d2-4eae-9395-d1e67484877\",\"tool_call\":{\"shellToolCall\":{\"args\":{\"command\":\"cd /Users/user/work/delegate-fixtures && gh issue view 4 --comments\",\"workingDirectory\":\"\",\"timeout\":30000,\"toolCallId\":\"tool_fca866d8-f4d2-4eae-9395-d1e67484877\",\"simpleCommands\":[\"cd\",\"gh\"],\"hasInputRedirect\":false,\"hasOutputRedirect\":false,\"parsingResult\":{\"parsingFailed\":false,\"executableCommands\":[{\"name\":\"cd\",\"args\":[{\"type\":\"word\",\"value\":\"/Users/user/work/delegate-fixtures\"}],\"fullText\":\"cd /Users/user/work/delegate-fixtures\"},{\"name\":\"gh\",\"args\":[{\"type\":\"word\",\"value\":\"issue\"},{\"type\":\"word\",\"value\":\"view\"},{\"type\":\"number\",\"value\":\"4\"},{\"type\":\"word\",\"value\":\"--comments\"}],\"fullText\":\"gh issue view 4 --comments\"}],\"hasRedirects\":false,\"hasCommandSubstitution\":false,\"redirects\":[]},\"fileOutputThresholdBytes\":\"40000\",\"isBackground\":false,\"skipApproval\":false,\"timeoutBehavior\":\"TIMEOUT_BEHAVIOR_BACKGROUND\",\"hardTimeout\":86400000,\"descri [... omitted end of long line]","contentTruncat