{"type":"assistant","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"### 1. Contradictions\n- **#17 “reuse cursor parser”** vs Claude `assistant`/`tool_use` and `system/*` noise, not `tool_call` — **extend shared parser, don’t share blindly**.\n- **#17 “or fallback probe chose”** vs #4 probe **no disallowedTools fallback** — **plan-only only; strike fallback wording**.\n- **`origin/main` `build_argv`/`supervise`** hardcode cursor-agent (`--print`, `--trust`, `backend: \"cursor\"`) vs fixture argv `claude -p --verbose --permission-mode` — **Claude backend owns argv; route by model `backend`** (#15).\n- **Cost**: #17 `total_cost_usd` vs `finalize` `compute_cost` from table — **report backend cost; `cost_estimated=false`** (#15).\n- **`Usage` camelCase** vs Claude result `input_tokens`/`cache_read_input_tokens` — **normalize in Claude parse path**.\n- **#7 run unknown model exit 2** vs Claude bad-model job with stream `is_error` — **validate ids at CLI; in-run model errors → job ERROR**.\n- **#11 “backend not implemented”** vs #17 — **drop stub when Claude ships**.\n\n### 2. Unstated defaults\n- Fake binary env name (mirror `CURSOR_AGENT_BIN`) — **pick `CLAUDE_BIN` or `DELEGATE_CLAUDE_BIN`**.\n- Doctor login probe command — **match spec “claude equivalent”; document in doctor**.\n- Bundled id → `claude --model` string — **use table ids as CLI passes them**.\n- New-run session — **generate UUID, `--session-id`; resume `--resume`** (#4).\n- `permission_denials` on record — **surface when non-empty** (#4).\n\n### 3. Failure cases (no behaviour)\n- **`permission_denials` without refusal fixture** — **ERROR or DONE_WITH_CONCERNS + denials text; record field**.\n- **Truncated stdout (no `type:result`)** — **ERROR like cursor cancel path**.\n- **Plan-mode writing Bash** (#4 untested) — **defer; document risk**.\n\n### 4. Acceptance vs spec/code\n- **Parser test “auto-mode refusal”** with no recorded refusal — **test `permission_denials` parsing; optional synthetic line**.\n- **E2E “fake claude replaying fixtures”** vs cursor one-liner fake — **NDJSON fixture replayer, not `FAKE_AGENT` shape**.\n- **Live fixture** — **must run `redact.jq` like #6** (#4 comment).\n\n### Fixture-driven parser deltas (vs `tests/fixtures/`)\nClaude: ignore `system/hook_*`, `commands_changed`, `rate_limit_event`; progress from `tool_use`/`tool_result`, not `tool_call`; terminal `type:result` carries `total_cost_usd`, `permission_denials`, `is_error` over `subtype`; usage snake_case; errors may exit 1 with `subtype:success`. Unlike pi: no `agent_end`/`stopReason`; exit code unreliable. Unlike cursor: no `thinking/delta`; different `init` shape.\n\nSTATUS: DONE_WITH_CONCERNS"}]},"session_id":"42a2d878-df96-4e92-9fef-880dad80ff16"}
